    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28531" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mellĕus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		mel, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to honey, honey-</i>
			(post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sapor,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 14, 15, § 51</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">color,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 16, 16, § 48</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sardonyches,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					37, 6, 23, § 89</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sucus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					36, 19, 33, § 140</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crustum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Eph. Parecb. 12</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>honeysweet,
				delightful, charming</i> (post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">moduli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 6, p. 175, 31</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adulatio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Ep. 18 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			</div>
